  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given:\n\n8a3 + 27b3 = 16 and 2a + 3b = 4\n\nConcept used:\n\n1. (A + B)² = A² + B² + 2AB\n\n2. (A + B)³ = A³ + B³ + 3AB(A + B)\n\nCalculation:\n\n8a3 + 27b3 = 16 ....(1)\n\n⇒ (2a + 3b)³ - 18ab(2a + 3b) = 16\n\n⇒ 4³ - 18ab × 4 = 16\n\n⇒ 72ab = 64 - 16\n\n⇒ 72ab = 48\n\n⇒ ab = 2/3 ....(2)\n\n(2a + 3b) = 4 ....(3)\n\n⇒ 4a² + 12ab + 9b² = 16\n\n⇒ 4a² + 9b² = 16 - 12 × (2/3)\n\n⇒ 4a2 + 9b2 = 8 ....(3)\n\nNow,\n\n(8a3 + 27b3)(2a + 3b) = 64\n\n⇒ 16a⁴ + 54ab³ + 24a³b + 81b⁴ = 64\n\n⇒ 16a4 + 81b4 + 6ab(4a2 + 9b2) = 64\n\n⇒ 16a4 + 81b4 + 6 × (2/3) × 8 = 64\n\n⇒ 16a4 + 81b4 = 64 - 32\n\n⇒ 16a4 + 81b4 = 32\n\n∴ The required value is 32.",
